{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">河北秦皇島市一個屋苑地舖發生火警，最少8死3傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發於凌晨約3時40分，有民眾拍攝到到當地海港區一間地舖火光熊熊並發生爆炸，多輛消防車趕到現場撲救，大約1小時後救熄。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FIRE-1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026rvaNcFaN711787201073.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.FIRE-1200_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天光後見到，見到起火的商舖所在的大樓外牆熏黑，當局正在調查起火原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T05:06:37.304925+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}